              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kelley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very nice; use the best quality you can find or it will taste rather muddy. First time I made it with premium bar stock it was not that nice. Second time (my husband loves Scotch) I used a premium Russian vodka and a premium single malt Scotch....delish!"
